    <briefdescription>
<para>OpenGL Vertex Buffer Object (VBO) wrapper. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A VBO stores vertex data (positions, texture coordinates, normals, etc.) in GPU memory.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>The buffer is created with GL_STATIC_DRAW usage. </para>
</simplesect>
